# Velnora — Full Implementation Roadmap

> **Transform SpendWise from a static expense tracker into a private, local-first personal financial command center.**

This plan is organized into **6 macro-phases** containing **25 sub-phases**, designed for sequential execution. Each phase leaves the app launchable and preserves all existing user data.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Core Rule: No calculation logic will be altered.** All existing functions in [`finance.ts`](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/SpendWise/src/utils/finance.ts) (`budgetSignals`, `categorySpend`, `categoryStatus`, `topThreeCategories`, `currentNoSpendStreak`, `weeklyReport`, `getLast30DaysSpend`, `calculateNetWorth`, `formatMoney`) remain untouched unless explicitly stated.

