### Critical Observations

1. **~100+ hardcoded color values** scattered across all 6 screens — every `StyleSheet` uses literal hex values like `#F4F6F5`, `#1F2928`, `#184B43`
2. **No design token system** — spacing, typography, radii, shadows are all ad-hoc per screen
3. **`Ui.tsx` uses a dark color scheme** (`#111827`, `#06B6D4`) that conflicts with the light app theme — this component appears orphaned
4. **`UserPreferences` type** has only `dailyReminder`, `currency`, `compactMode` — no theme support
5. **`autoLogRecurringExpenses()`** on line 184 of `database.ts` silently creates expense records — flagged for replacement in Phase 10
6. **`NavigationContainer`** uses `AppTheme` directly — no dynamic theme switching
7. **`StatusBar style="dark"` is hardcoded** in `App.tsx` line 45
8. **No privacy/masking system** exists anywhere
9. **Transaction model is expense-only** — no income/transfer/refund distinction in the expense table

